/-!
# Shared coordinates for the intrinsic seed algebra

These are literal data, not certificates of rank, independence or multiplication.
`adaptedColumns` is the saved column basis, in its original order. Matrices act
on columns; packed row bit j is column j, and a flattened matrix bit (56*i+j)
is its (i,j) entry. `ambientRadicalForm` uses the original 1221 exterior forms.

Generated by `source/generate_data.py` from the reproducible witness of
`Scratch/J4FleetGuidance/SeedCentralizer/explore.py` in the source checkout.
The ATLAS matrix provenance is retained in `Model.Data`. All identities involving
these definitions require independent Lean proofs.
-/

@[expose] public section
